### Requests for the IntelliJ HTTP client: click the green arrow next to each "###" block.
@checkout = http://localhost:18101
@risk = http://localhost:18102
@payment = http://localhost:18103
@agent = http://localhost:18104

### 1. Open a checkout at a store terminal (POS) - expected 201 Created
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "storeId": "CASA-MAARIF-01",
  "channel": "POS",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "SKU-CAFE-500", "label": "Cafe moulu 500 g", "quantity": 2, "unitPriceMinor": 4590 },
    { "sku": "SKU-THE-250", "label": "The vert 250 g", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceMinor": 2250 }
  ],
  "payment": { "method": "CARD", "token": "tok_visa_4242", "last4": "4242", "country": "MA" },
  "context": { "ipCountry": "MA", "deviceId": "POS-TERM-07" }
}

> {%
    client.global.set("posCheckoutId", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. Same Idempotency-Key sent twice - first call 201, second call 200 with the same id
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-replay-001

{
  "storeId": "CASA-MAARIF-01",
  "channel": "WEB",
  "customerId": "C00042",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "SKU-CASQUE-BT", "label": "Casque Bluetooth", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceMinor": 89900 }
  ],
  "payment": { "method": "CARD", "token": "tok_mastercard_5454", "last4": "5454", "country": "MA" },
  "context": { "ipCountry": "MA", "deviceId": "web-fp-8f2c1a" }
}

### 3. Raw card number instead of a PSP token - expected 422 (PCI-DSS rule)
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "storeId": "CASA-MAARIF-01",
  "channel": "POS",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "SKU-CAFE-500", "label": "Cafe moulu 500 g", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceMinor": 4590 } ],
  "payment": { "method": "CARD", "token": "4111 1111 1111 1111", "last4": "1111", "country": "MA" }
}

### 4. Missing fields - expected 400 with the list of errors
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "channel": "POS",
  "currency": "mad",
  "lines": []
}

### 5. Latest checkouts
GET {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts?limit=10

### 6. Online, 8 999 MAD, French card, Moroccan IP - risk REVIEW (score 60)
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "storeId": "WEB-SHOP",
  "channel": "WEB",
  "customerId": "C00077",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "SKU-LAPTOP-14", "label": "Ordinateur portable 14 pouces", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceMinor": 899900 } ],
  "payment": { "method": "CARD", "token": "tok_visa_fr_1881", "last4": "1881", "country": "FR" },
  "context": { "ipCountry": "MA", "deviceId": "web-fp-77aa01" }
}

> {%
    client.global.set("reviewCheckoutId", response.body.id);
%}

### 7. Risk decision of the checkout created by request 6 (wait 1 second after request 6)
GET {{risk}}/api/v1/risk-assessments/{{reviewCheckoutId}}

### 8. Online, 25 000 MAD, French card, Moroccan IP - risk BLOCK (score 80)
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "storeId": "WEB-SHOP",
  "channel": "WEB",
  "customerId": "C00078",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "SKU-TV-75", "label": "Televiseur 75 pouces", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceMinor": 2500000 } ],
  "payment": { "method": "CARD", "token": "tok_visa_fr_9001", "last4": "9001", "country": "FR" },
  "context": { "ipCountry": "MA", "deviceId": "web-fp-78bb02" }
}

### 9. Card testing: run this request 5 times quickly - the 3rd gives CARD_VELOCITY, the 5th CARD_TESTING (REVIEW)
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "storeId": "CASA-MAARIF-01",
  "channel": "POS",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "SKU-CHEWING-GUM", "label": "Chewing-gum", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceMinor": 500 } ],
  "payment": { "method": "CARD", "token": "tok_stolen_0001", "last4": "0001", "country": "MA" }
}

### 10. Payment of a checkout (payment-service) - replace the id
GET {{payment}}/api/v1/payments/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### ---------- End-to-end saga (checkout + risk + payment running) ----------

### 11. Status of the store checkout created by request 1 - expected PAID about 1 second later
GET {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts/{{posCheckoutId}}

### 12. Status of the online checkout created by request 6 - expected ON_HOLD with the risk reasons
GET {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts/{{reviewCheckoutId}}

### 13. A supervisor approves the held checkout of request 6 - then run request 12 again: PAID
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts/{{reviewCheckoutId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "APPROVE",
  "reviewer": "amina.supervisor",
  "comment": "Customer confirmed the purchase by phone"
}

### 14. Store payment with a card without funds - then run request 15: DECLINED (INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS)
POST {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$random.uuid}}

{
  "storeId": "CASA-MAARIF-01",
  "channel": "POS",
  "currency": "MAD",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "SKU-CAFE-500", "label": "Cafe moulu 500 g", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceMinor": 4590 } ],
  "payment": { "method": "CARD", "token": "tok_insufficient_01", "last4": "0002", "country": "MA" }
}

> {%
    client.global.set("declinedCheckoutId", response.body.id);
%}

### 15. Status of the checkout of request 14
GET {{checkout}}/api/v1/checkouts/{{declinedCheckoutId}}

### ---------- AI agent (agent-service) ----------

### 16. Investigation of the checkout held by request 6 (run request 6 first, then wait a few seconds)
GET {{agent}}/api/v1/investigations/{{reviewCheckoutId}}

### 17. Latest investigations
GET {{agent}}/api/v1/investigations?limit=10

### 18. Ask the agent to investigate the checkout of request 6 again (about 15-30 s with Gemini)
# @timeout 120
POST {{agent}}/api/v1/investigations/{{reviewCheckoutId}}

### 19. Payment history of the customer of request 6, as the agent sees it (risk-service)
GET {{risk}}/api/v1/risk-assessments?customerId=C00077&limit=10
